item.description:
• It is no longer necessary to repeat array filters on all tags to filter a loop.
Now, if the filter is defined only on the i+1 tag, it is applied globally to the entire loop.
This change is activated only when the prerelease tag {o.preReleaseFeatureIn=4024000} is set (by default in v5).
To maintain backward compatibility, if at least one filter is defined on the i-th part, the previous rule still applies. Before: {d.myArray[i, i>0].id}
{d.myArray[i, i>0].name}
{d.myArray[i+1, i>0]} After: {d.myArray[i].id}
{d.myArray[i].name}
{d.myArray[i+1, i>0]}
